# width: 120
# Rust's `Create…` menu (src/app/context_menus.zig `plus_tree`) from
# the empty strip's `󰐕` at column 32: the four groups with their icons
# and the enabled integration chips as a fifth, each a `▸ ` row, the
# frame at x 31 closing straight under the last row — the title sits
# INSIDE the top border, so `rows + 2` is the whole frame and there is
# no blank line above the bottom edge (2026-09-20: `menuSize` used to
# reserve a row for the title as well, and this file pinned the gap); a
# hover on a group shows its rows beside it (the child hung from the
# row), each leaf ending in its chord; Esc closes.
click 32 1
expect screen contains "┌ Create… ──────────┐"
expect screen contains "│   New          ▸ │"
expect screen contains "│   Open         ▸ │"
expect screen contains "│ 󰚩  AI           ▸ │"
expect screen contains "│   Dock         ▸ │"
expect screen contains "│   Integrations ▸ │"
expect screen lacks "│                   │"
hover 36 3
expect screen contains "│   New          ▸ │┌───────────────────────────┐"
expect screen contains "│   Scratch buffer         │"
expect screen contains "│   From clipboard         │"
expect screen contains "│   HTTP request           │"
expect screen contains "│   Shell     Ctrl+Shift+` │"
expect screen contains "│   Browser tab    Space B │"
expect screen contains "│   Tab page      Ctrl+K n │"
hover 36 4
expect screen contains "Dual file panes (commander)"
expect screen lacks "Tab page"
hover 36 5
expect screen contains "Claude Code session"
hover 36 6
expect screen contains "Log tail"
hover 36 7
expect screen contains "Browser"
key esc
expect screen lacks "Create…"
